# the trained onion classifier is a small pure-numpy JSON - it MUST
# ship with the app (grader.py loads it at run time)
!models/onion_clf.json

# the scikit-learn "is it an onion?" model - same deal, plain JSON,
# numpy-only at run time, the web app needs it to answer "not found"
!models/onion_presence.json

# the fine-tuned YOLOv8 detector (6 MB) - the app's YOLO mode needs it
!models/onion_yolo.pt
